# Generated CY2026 data and the registry mirror are COMMITTED, deliberately.
# The generator reads CMS source files from outside this repo, so a fresh
# clone cannot regenerate them — ignoring them would leave a clone unable to
# compile or test. Regenerate with `npm run gen:data` when a new CMS quarter
# lands; the generator's census self-checks fail loudly on unexpected drift.
err*.txt
out*.json
test-*.mjs
